# Dev Notes 25 — Worker Layout Option C Context Session v1

## Date

2026-06-07

## Branch

```text
worker-layout-option-c-context-session-v1
```

## Purpose

This branch continues Worker Layout Option C by extracting worker context/session helpers from `llama_worker/llama.mjs` while keeping `llama_worker/llama.mjs` as the stable worker entrypoint and composition root.

The extraction is intentionally narrow:

- context creation retry service;
- session service / session eviction / session reset helper.

## Source base

Implementation was staged from the formatted mirror:

```text
/mnt/data/runtime-dev-repo-modularization.zip
/mnt/data/context_session_work/runtime-dev-repo-modularization
```

Active source truth remains GitHub branch:

```text
https://github.com/Main-Michael-Sparks/runtime-dev-repo/tree/modularization
```

## Explicit non-goals preserved

This branch does not include:

- model/reset/shutdown lifecycle extraction;
- prompt runner extraction;
- worker protocol router extraction;
- parent runtime changes;
- worker protocol redesign;
- model path/model identity behavior changes;
- configOverride surface changes;
- prompt/output semantic changes;
- cleanup or optimization outside the narrow extraction;
- child-process/native containment redesign.

